# Android-only Tark patches (A1), applied after Tark's shared patches. They
# live outside patches/tarka/ so the Mac and Windows series never see them.
#
# ungoogled's enable-extra-locales.patch (desktop) deletes Chromium's Android
# branch in build/config/locales.gni, which breaks gn on Android
# (components/strings removes "cy", which is then in neither list). Only the
# extended_locales half comes back: the same patch makes Android's
# locale_settings grd emit Welsh paks, so Welsh stays in platform_pak_locales.
locales-android-branch.patch
#
# ungoogled builds chrome/browser/safe_browsing without Safe Browsing: the
# target's base block is `if (false)` and defines no deps, so its is_android
# block's `deps +=` is an undefined identifier on Android. That block (Safe
# Browsing's Android UI and API pieces) is off as well.
safe-browsing-no-android-deps.patch
#
# ungoogled's add-suggestions-url-field.patch gives ResetTemplateURL a
# suggestions_url argument, which it writes over the engine's own; Android's
# callers (desktop never compiles them) pass the engine's existing one, so
# they behave as upstream.
search-engines-android-suggestions-url.patch
